<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Macronix 1996 profit up 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Macronix 1996 profit up 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macronix International Corp, one of Taiwan's leading semiconductor makers, said on Thursday its pre-tax profit in 1996 was T$3.172 billion, up 26 percent from 1995.</p>
<p>Macronix's 1996 sales revenues totalled T$10.26 billion, up 16 percent from 1995, a company statement said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
